  "term": "GHQ",
  "definition": "GHQ usually refers to the General Health Questionnaire, with the GHQ-12 being a commonly used brief screening measure for assessing mental health. The packet supports that it is used for screening rather than providing a full account of mental health complexity, especially in younger groups.",
