      "reasons": [
        "The packet supports GHQ-12 as a widely used screening tool for mental health assessment, but it does not explicitly support the expansion of GHQ as “General Health Questionnaire.”",
        "The claim about GHQ-12 being used for younger groups is only partially supported; the packet says traditional scoring methods and cutoffs may not adequately capture mental health complexities of younger populations, but it does not establish the broader characterization in the definition as written."
